message: "If you use these course materials, please cite the archived edition."
title: "Vlad Kulikov Open Courses: Complete Bilingual Collection"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Kulikov
    given-names: Vlad
abstract: >-
  Complete English and Russian editions of Modern LLMs, Reinforcement Learning
  for LLM, and Information Theory for Machine Learning. Includes lectures,
  illustrations, quizzes with browser answer checking, exercises and worked
  solutions, existing notebooks and original files, six PDF and six EPUB books,
  a static website and its source. Code execution is not required or provided
  by the website. Course content is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0; standalone code and
  publication tooling are Apache-2.0 unless a more specific notice applies.
version: "2026.4"
date-released: 2026-10-28
